            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Netflix reportedly exploring bid for Warner Bros. assets: Reuters",
            "description": "<p>According to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/exclusive-netflix-taps-bank-explore-225139210.html\">a Reuters report</a>, Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) is exploring a bid for Warner Bros. Discovery (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>) assets, such as the media giant's studio and streaming business. This comes after Netflix announced a<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/netflix-announces-10-for-1-stock-split-as-company-aims-to-make-stock-more-accessible-for-employees-204922842.html\"> 10-for-1 stock split.</a></p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Allie Canal</a> talks more about this report.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "According to a Reuters report, Netflix (NFLX) is exploring a bid for Warner Bros. Discovery (WBD) assets, such as the media giant's studio and streaming business. This comes after Netflix announced a 10-for-1 stock split. Yahoo Finance senior reporter Allie Canal talks more about this report. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
